@ThorntonEnergy.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7159

### Rate plans
GET {{ThorntonEnergy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ratePlans
Accept: application/json

### Jane's bills (newest first)
GET {{ThorntonEnergy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/bills?customerId=1
Accept: application/json

### Log in
POST {{ThorntonEnergy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "password": "jane123"
}